---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const updated = new Date().toISOString().slice(0, 10);
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms"
  description="Terms of use for Creek Mechanical's tools, calculators, and reference data."
>
  <article class="prose wrap">
    <h1>Terms</h1>
    <p class="updated">Last updated: {updated}</p>

    <div class="notice">
      This is a placeholder terms page pending real legal review. Do not
      treat it as final or legally binding.
    </div>

    <h2>Acceptable use</h2>
    <p>
      The tools, calculators, and reference data on this site are provided
      for informational and engineering-convenience purposes. You agree not
      to use them in a way that disrupts the site or attempts to
      circumvent its intended operation.
    </p>

    <h2>No warranty</h2>
    <p>
      Tools and calculators are provided "as is," without warranty of any
      kind. Results are not a substitute for professional engineering
      judgment, and nothing on this site constitutes a licensed
      Professional Engineer's sign-off on a design. Always verify
      calculations independently before relying on them for a real design,
      build, or safety-critical decision.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>These terms may change as the site grows; the "last updated" date above will reflect the latest revision.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
